    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29069" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσ-θεώρητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to observe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				511b13
			</span></i>; <i>scarcely visible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύπημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Spir.</u>
					1.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				15.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hard to understand</i> or <i>reduce to theory</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					49.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.31.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.141
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.84
			</span></i>.</div>
